  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.27 Fossil fuelfired",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.27 “Fossil fuelfired” means the combustion of fossil fuel or any derivative of fossil fuel alone, or, if in combination with any other fuel, fossil fuel comprises 51% or greater of the annual heat input on a BTU basis.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36 (formerly Env-A 3203.28)",
